# Holafly

> Holafly is a global eSIM provider offering unlimited data eSIMs for travelers, with destination-specific plans, regional and global multi-country plans, and the Always On benefit included on unlimited plans. Holafly also offers Holafly Plans, monthly international data plans (separate from trip-based eSIMs) with options including unlimited hotspot.

Holafly's eSIM products fall into these categories:
- Destination eSIMs: unlimited data plans for a specific country or city, valid only for that destination.
- Regional and Global eSIMs: multi-country unlimited data plans covering an entire region (e.g. Europe, North America) or global coverage across many countries, which typically include a shared hotspot allowance of 500MB to 1GB.
- Always On: included with unlimited eSIM plans. Provides 1GB of backup data that refreshes every month, so travelers stay connected even if they forget to buy a plan or run into an emergency.
- Holafly Plans: monthly international data plans, separate from the trip-based eSIMs above. Instead of a fixed validity period for a single trip, they renew monthly and provide ongoing international data connectivity, with plan options that include unlimited hotspot/tethering.

Content is available in multiple languages via subfolders on esim.holafly.com (e.g. /es/, /pt/, /fr/, /de/, plus other locales).

